OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1785853117
OL,3,CMayors react to Andy Burnham's plans
OL,4,Cto give them share of income tax
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has announced plans for
OL,7,FEngland's mayors to keep a share of
OL,8,Ftaxes collected in their area, stating
OL,9,Fthe proposals will give them "more in
OL,10,Ftheir hands" to empower their regions.
OL,12,FThe Prime Minister has said the mayors
OL,13,Fwill be allowed to keep a slice of
OL,14,Fincome tax and business rates to spend
OL,15,Fon their priorities, as part of his
OL,16,Fdrive to push power out of Westminster.
OL,18,FMayors in the North East and North
OL,19,FYorkshire have given a mixed response
OL,20,Fto Mr Burnham's idea.
OL,26,@qD@^OUrD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/6
