OL,3,CMayors react to Andy Burnham's plans
OL,4,Cto give them share of income tax
OL,6,FMinisters will retain an equalisation
OL,7,Fsystem, so areas where less tax is
OL,8,Fcollected continue to receive
OL,9,Ffinancial support.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/6
